eature development beyond GA-bar quality work\n41\t- Deprecating alternative GenAI serving paths\n42\t\n43\t## Open Questions\n44\t\n45\t1. The GA scope itself depends on HLR-1's assessment — until it lands, the\n46\t   size of the stability and hardening work is an estimate.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a98f47588918b14e","agent_id":"a7c43dc9dd403e7b9","session_id":"0204fee7-ce49-4572-ac85-f81f526b0c75","uuid":"c05111c7-95c4-4d45-8453-55e312567559","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:17:56.659Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-812e8633b88ad8a2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
