mediation beyond one sprint of effort or\n92\t  spanning distinct surfaces, the work should be split along those surface\n93\t  boundaries.\n94\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9de9ef08aa817306","agent_id":"a3f3f864f5c7bc769","session_id":"0204fee7-ce49-4572-ac85-f81f526b0c75","uuid":"87ac47ef-040f-46f5-994c-543b045911c8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:20:05.600Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5b7363b4f0a2675","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
