nce Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- SLO targets for the GA distribution are documented and published.\n56\t- The backport policy is documented and published.\n57\t- The supported configuration matrix is documented and covers every\n58\t  configuration the GA release supports.\n59\t- The support-posture documents are reviewed and approved by the responsible\n60\t  support and product stakeholders.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-3 (P0): \"Production support posture is in place: documented SLO\n65\t  targets, backport policy, and supported configuration matrix.\"\n66\t\n67\t## Risks / Notes\n68\t\n69\t- SLO targets and the backport policy require stakeholder sign-off; the\n70\t  engineering deliverable is the documented, reviewed posture itself.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9de9ef08aa817306","agent_id":"a3f3f864f5c7bc769","session_id":"0204fee7-ce49-4572-ac85-f81f526b0c75","uuid":"72e83b03-9f37-4ba1-a842-140d2ae2af03","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:20:08.165Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a84cc7c4c81ea715","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
