 Documentation of default Dashboard enablement of Llama Stack management\n56\t  for entitled clusters.\n57\t- Removal or replacement of TP-era caveats and disclaimers on surfaces that\n58\t  are GA with this graduation.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- Documentation covers all GA capabilities delivered by this strategy's\n63\t  implementation work: versioned APIs and deprecation policy, support\n64\t  posture, guardrails integration, and default Dashboard enablement.\n65\t- Migration notes from Tech Preview are written against the actual tested\n66\t  upgrade path and verified against it.\n67\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implementations it\n68\t  describes.\n69\t- No TP-era experimental disclaimers remain on surfaces that ship GA with\n70\t  this graduation.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- HLR-6 (P2): \"Documentation is uplifted to GA standards, including\n75\t  migration notes from TP.\"\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9de9ef08aa817306","agent_id":"a3f3f864f5c7bc769","session_id":"0204fee7-ce49-4572-ac85-f81f526b0c75","uuid":"19cde6b8-3d0c-4159-b090-ddc2480280e3","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:20:11.782Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91e1c2340ef83022","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
